sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Route as OpenShift Route / VirtualService<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Quarkus<br/>localhost:8080
    participant Storage as PVC / External DB

    Note over Client,Storage: TrustyAI Service Request Path

    Client->>Route: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS Terminated
    Route->>Proxy: Forward to :8443<br/>TLS
    Proxy->>KubeAPI: TokenReview<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    KubeAPI-->>Proxy: Auth Result
    alt Authorized
        Proxy->>TrustyAI: Forward to localhost:8080<br/>HTTP
        TrustyAI->>Storage: Read/Write Data
        Storage-->>TrustyAI: Data Response
        TrustyAI-->>Proxy: Response
        Proxy-->>Route: TLS Response
        Route-->>Client: HTTPS Response
    else Unauthorized
        Proxy-->>Route: 401/403
        Route-->>Client: Authentication Failure
    end

    Note over Client,Storage: Operator Control Plane

    participant Manager as Operator Manager
    participant DSC as DSC ConfigMap
    participant OSConfig as OpenShift APIServer Config
    participant Kueue as Kueue API (optional)

    Manager->>OSConfig: Read TLS Security Profile
    OSConfig-->>Manager: TLS Config (or Mozilla Intermediate default)
    Manager->>DSC: Read trustyai-dsc-config
    DSC-->>Manager: LMEval online mode, code exec permissions
    Manager->>Kueue: Check kueue.x-k8s.io/v1beta1 availability
    Kueue-->>Manager: Available / Not Found (graceful fallback)

    Manager->>KubeAPI: Watch CRDs (TrustyAIService, EvalHub,<br/>LMEvalJob, GuardrailsOrchestrator,<br/>NemoGuardrails, TrustyAI)
    KubeAPI-->>Manager: Resource Events
    Manager->>KubeAPI: Create/Update/Delete owned resources<br/>(Deployments, Services, ConfigMaps)

    Note over Client,Storage: Webhook Conversions

    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS

    KubeAPI->>Webhook: CRD Conversion Request<br/>EvalHub v1 ↔ v1alpha1<br/>TrustyAIService v1 ↔ v1alpha1
    Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Converted Resource

    Note over Client,Storage: Metrics Collection

    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant MetricsSvc as metrics-service<br/>8080/TCP
    participant ProxyMetrics as controller-manager-metrics-service<br/>8443/TCP

    Prom->>MetricsSvc: Scrape :8080
    MetricsSvc-->>Prom: Metrics
    Prom->>ProxyMetrics: Scrape :8443<br/>via kube-rbac-proxy
    ProxyMetrics-->>Prom: Metrics
